# Privacy Policy for LenDen Mart

**Effective Date:** April 29, 2026

Welcome to **LenDen Mart (लेनदेन बजार)**.

LenDen Mart is a local marketplace platform where users can buy, sell, and promote locally made products and services. Businesses can also advertise through our platform by submitting their business details. To maintain trust, safety, and authenticity, all listings and business submissions are reviewed and verified by our admin team before publication.

We value your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your information when you use our mobile application.

---

## 1. Information We Collect

We may collect the following information from users:

### Personal Information

* Full Name
* Phone Number
* Email Address (if provided)
* Profile Information
* Business Information (for advertisers/business users)

### Location Information

* Device location (with your permission)
* Address or area details you provide for local buying and selling

### Listing Information

* Product details
* Photos uploaded by users
* Pricing information
* Product descriptions
* Contact preferences

### Device and Technical Information

* Device type
* Operating system
* App usage data
* Crash reports and analytics (if applicable)

---

## 2. How We Use Your Information

We use your information to:

* Create and manage your account
* Allow users to buy and sell products locally
* Verify users, listings, and business advertisements
* Improve trust and safety within the marketplace
* Help users connect with sellers and buyers
* Display relevant local listings
* Provide customer support
* Prevent fraud, scams, and misuse
* Improve app performance and user experience

---

## 3. Sharing of Information

Some information may be shared with other users for legitimate marketplace purposes, including:

* Name
* Phone number
* Location/Area
* Product details
* Business details

This helps buyers and sellers communicate safely and efficiently.

We only share information necessary for marketplace functionality and community trust.

We do **not sell personal information to third parties**.

---

## 4. Admin Verification

To ensure platform safety and authenticity:

* All product listings may be reviewed by admins
* Business advertisements require admin verification before approval
* Suspicious, false, or misleading content may be removed
* Accounts violating platform policies may be restricted or removed

---

## 5. Data Security

We take reasonable security measures to protect your information from unauthorized access, misuse, or disclosure.

While we work hard to keep your data secure, no digital platform can guarantee 100% security.

---

## 6. User Permissions

LenDen Mart may request access to:

### Location Permission

Used to help connect users with nearby buyers and sellers.

### Camera / Photos Permission

Used for uploading product images and business photos.

### Phone Permission (if applicable)

Used for contact verification and easier communication between users.

Permissions are only used for app functionality and user benefit.

---

## 7. Your Rights

You may:

* Update your profile information
* Request correction of inaccurate data
* Request deletion of your account (subject to verification and platform requirements)
* Contact us regarding privacy concerns

---

## 8. Children’s Privacy

LenDen Mart is not intended for children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.

---

## 9. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be reflected inside the app and/or on our official listing page.

Continued use of the app after updates means you accept the revised policy.

